WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.443
Suggest safe ways to protect land and water from damage.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:09.650
We can protect land and water by using bins, planting trees, avoiding dumping in

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.866
waterways, and teaching others not to pollute. Adults and authorities manage

00:00:13.866 --> 00:00:16.166
hazardous clean-up work and mining laws.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:21.977
Everyone can keep school surroundings tidy and conserve water. Looking after these

00:00:21.977 --> 00:00:23.625
resources protects our future.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:29.490
Plan a safe school anti-litter campaign with a poster and one action adults can help

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:29.826
perform.
